19. List Groups
List Group — ro‘yxatdagi elementlarni Bootstrap ko‘rinishida chiroyli guruhlab chiqarish uchun ishlatiladi.
<ul class="list-group">
    <li class="list-group-item">First item</li>
    <li class="list-group-item">Second item</li>
    <li class="list-group-item">Third item</li>
</ul>
Badge bilan
Badge o‘ng tomonga avtomatik joylashadi:
<ul class="list-group">
    <li class="list-group-item">
        New <span class="badge">12</span>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item">
        Deleted <span class="badge">5</span>
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item">
        Warnings <span class="badge">3</span>
    </li>
</ul>
//KEYWORD
.list-group       → list group yaratadi
.list-group-item  → har bir ro‘yxat elementi
.badge            → sonni ko‘rsatadi
 List Groups
→ Ro‘yxat elementlarini Bootstrap ko‘rinishida guruhlaydi.
→ .list-group → ro‘yxat guruhi.
→ .list-group-item → ro‘yxat elementi.
→ .badge → element yonida son ko‘rsatadi.
